          "answer": "more / most; comparison of πολύς — 1. Regular and irregular comparison"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "βελτίων / βέλτιστος",
          "answer": "better / best; another comparison of ἀγαθός — 1. Regular and irregular comparison"
        },
