          "prompt": "εἰ τοῦτο ποιεῖ, ἀδικεῖ.",
          "answer": "If he does this, he does wrong; open present condition. — 1. Conditions: open and future more vivid"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "εἰ τοῦτο ἐποίησεν, ἠδίκησεν.",
          "answer": "If he did this, he did wrong; open past condition. — 1. Conditions: open and future more vivid"
