          "answer": "If he stayed, he was saved; open past. — 3. Contrary-to-fact conditions"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "εἰ μὴ ἔφυγεν, ἀπέθανεν ἄν.",
          "answer": "If he had not fled, he would have died; negative past unreal. — 3. Contrary-to-fact conditions"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "past indicative + ἄν",
          "answer": "key signal in the ordinary unreal apodosis — 3. Contrary-to-fact conditions"
        },
        {
