          "answer": "masculine-neuter / feminine genitive singular — 2. Active perfect participles and infinitives"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "γεγραφέναι / γεγραφώς",
          "answer": "second perfect active infinitive / masculine participle — 2. Active perfect participles and infinitives"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "ἐλελύκειν",
          "answer": "active pluperfect, first singular — 3. Active pluperfects"
